  "releaseNotes": "Update v1.2.1: Enhanced metadata monitoring - GetAllCacheMetadata() now returns comprehensive expiration information including absolute/sliding expiration times, time until expiration, and expiration status for each cache item. Improves cache visibility and debugging capabilities.",
